# Source-to-room authoring (docs/architecture/SOURCE_TO_ROOM.md): the book text is licensed and
# never committed. Point KIT_SOURCE_TEXT or config/kit_source.json at a local copy. Rooms Kit
# writes from it are cached per session beside the database and are never committed either.
config/kit_source.json
*.authored/
